"text":[{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","review_id":"LAI8qKkYZV1NKs2pK6DaAQ","date":"2020-12-22T21:41:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.955014705657959,"text_excerpt":"I don't often visit coffee shops, but Drink Beauty blew me away! It's a fabulous girly shop with posh drinks and the atmosphere to match it perfectly. The interior was so cute and chic! If it were not for the pandemic, it would be an ideal place to come with your girlfriends to hang out! I had the Purple Rain Latte (the complimentary Yelp Elite Perk). It was really a lavender-colored latte! How fun is that? Although it didn't taste much like coffee, it was absolutely DELICIOUS. It contained taro, goji berry, lavender, white chocolate, and milk, of course. This was a caffeine-free drink. I noticed they offer many caffeine-free options if you need it. What amazed me was their machine to pri..."},{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","review_id":"3tnIbNArIGnYqxCZzdWB6g","date":"2020-12-17T19:44:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9548923373222351,"text_excerpt":"Drink beauty is such a cute coffee spot! They have a super trendy little shop that's great for photos! I got the purple rain drink and loved it! I love the flavor of taro, so this was really good for me! The girl working was super nice and willing to help if you had any questions! Loved all of the little things they had in the shop as well like candles, stickers, and candies!"},{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","review_id":"VJrJFPqYiy24gvIe0QWIHQ","date":"2020-03-10T17:05:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9432622790336609,"text_excerpt":"A welcome variation on the tradition coffee/tea spots!! I've passed Drink Beauty so many times, always curious but confused. Just wasn't sure what it was or why I would stop. So finally, last week I dropped in. Really glad I did. Drink Beauty is a health minded coffee style shop with the added bonus of what looks like locally produced beauty products at the front. I've never thought of needing to combine cosmetics and coffee, but then you are what you eat (drink?). My take on drink beauty is a bar that offers caffeinated and non-caffeinated beverages with a focus on nutrient rich ingredients to give you a glow from the inside out. Matcha, Latte, Tea, spices, it's all in there and you can ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","photo_id":"xMCwZzgmNflxtdT-bQ_4wA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xMCwZzgmNflxtdT-bQ_4wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8923582434654236},{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","photo_id":"bC0bIJ6-HQRjHeMvc6yk3w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bC0bIJ6-HQRjHeMvc6yk3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8443281650543213},{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","photo_id":"AUYrbe22HgG_ZBlxhi3lbg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/AUYrbe22HgG_ZBlxhi3lbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8349583148956299},{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","photo_id":"Z9ivalQBtcFf13zETNqqMA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z9ivalQBtcFf13zETNqqMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7329308986663818},{"business_id":"_dDW5rc7MKCOzhRewe3Kfg","photo_id":"Nd4Te5iAcWXhh7cUV0pIgw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Nd4Te5iAcWXhh7cUV0pIgw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.710905134677887}]},"notebook_case":null}
